Goal 1 (goal): x = y.
Proof:
  x
= { by axiom 1 (hyp) }
  f(X, f(f(f(Y, Z), x), f(f(Z, X), f(x, X))))
= { by lemma 25 }
  f(X, f(f(f(Y, Z), x), f(X, f(x, X))))
= { by lemma 25 }
